OL,3,ACourt of Appeal reserves judgment in
OL,4,Aresidents' bid to challenge Drumcree
OL,5,Aparade
OL,6,
OL,7,FCourt of Appeal in Belfast reserves
OL,8,Fjudgement on a bid by Garvaghy Road
OL,9,Fresidents to challenge the decision to
OL,10,Fallow an Orange Order parade to proceed
OL,11,Fdown the mainly nationalist road
OL,13,FJudges listened to four hours of legal
OL,14,Farguments on Monday inside a packed
OL,15,Fcourt room
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland Lady Chief Justice
OL,18,FSiobhan Keegan said they would work to
OL,19,Fa "swift time frame" but could not give
OL,20,Fa date for a decision
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
