OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACourt of Appeal reserves judgment in
OL,4,Aresidents' bid to challenge Drumcree
OL,5,Aparade
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after eight days of deadlock
OL,8,Fover the parade down Portadown's
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road since it was decided it
OL,10,Fcould proceed, a decision that reopened
OL,11,Fwhat was once Northern Ireland's most
OL,12,Fbitter parading disputes
OL,14,FResidents and protesters have
OL,15,Fperiodically blocked the road and
OL,16,Fmaintained a presence there for more
OL,17,Fthan a week
OL,19,FMeanwhile Orangemen have repeatedly
OL,20,Fattempted to complete the march but
OL,21,Fbeen have been turned back by police
OL,22,Fdue to it being unsafe to proceed
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
