OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACourt of Appeal reserves judgment in
OL,4,Aresidents' bid to challenge Drumcree
OL,5,Aparade
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the mid-to-late 1990s, the dispute
OL,8,Fabout the parade from Drumcree Church
OL,9,Fdown the Garvaghy Road created yearly
OL,10,Fstand-offs, accompanied with riots,
OL,11,Froadblock and killings - read more
OL,12,Fabout the history of the dispute
OL,14,FWith hundreds of people on the street,
OL,15,Fand rival groups not far apart, there's
OL,16,Fhuge relief nobody has yet been hurt
OL,17,Fbut the challenge is in making sure it
OL,18,Fstays that way, writes BBC News NI
OL,19,Fcommunities correspondent Mark Simpson
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
